    "name": "Silent Fangs: Stealthy Vampire's Tale",
    "steam_appid": 3668110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668110/extras/82eca57621dcd78311da4ccef74b7a5e.avif?t=1755744376\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Silent Fangs: Stealthy Vampire\u2019s Tale</i>, you awaken in a forgotten crypt, weakened and alone. Once a feared ruler of the night, you must now reclaim your power in a world that has long since buried your name. Set in a gothic medieval landscape and rendered in retro PS1 aesthetics, this fast-paced first-person stealth adventure challenges you to rise again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across battlements, infiltrate occupied castles, and silently dispatch those who stand in your way using precise parkour and stealth mechanics. With each conquered stronghold, your influence grows and so does your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re not alone in your dark quest. Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter a strange cast of funny yet intriguing NPCs gravediggers, cursed jesters, potion-sellers, and other medieval oddities who will aid you with cryptic advice, questionable tools, and unexpected friendship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668110/extras/8fda4eb647830f248965c88bbba6d207.avif?t=1755744376\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PS1-Inspired Gothic World</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a richly atmospheric medieval setting with low-poly visuals and haunting vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth + Parkour Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Wall-run, leap, climb, and sneak through enemy territory with fluid mobility and deadly silence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle Conquest System</strong> \u2013 Reclaim one fortress at a time to rebuild your dominion and revive the age of vampires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorable NPC Encounters</strong> \u2013 Meet bizarre allies who offer both comedy and mystery on your dark journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Power</strong> \u2013 Regain your vampiric abilities as you grow stronger, unlocking new traversal and combat options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you return as ruler of the night, or fade once more into myth?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668110/extras/82eca57621dcd78311da4ccef74b7a5e.avif?t=1755744376\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Silent Fangs: Stealthy Vampire\u2019s Tale</i>, you awaken in a forgotten crypt, weakened and alone. Once a feared ruler of the night, you must now reclaim your power in a world that has long since buried your name. Set in a gothic medieval landscape and rendered in retro PS1 aesthetics, this fast-paced first-person stealth adventure challenges you to rise again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across battlements, infiltrate occupied castles, and silently dispatch those who stand in your way using precise parkour and stealth mechanics. With each conquered stronghold, your influence grows and so does your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re not alone in your dark quest. Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter a strange cast of funny yet intriguing NPCs gravediggers, cursed jesters, potion-sellers, and other medieval oddities who will aid you with cryptic advice, questionable tools, and unexpected friendship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668110/extras/8fda4eb647830f248965c88bbba6d207.avif?t=1755744376\" width=616 height=200 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PS1-Inspired Gothic World</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a richly atmospheric medieval setting with low-poly visuals and haunting vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth + Parkour Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Wall-run, leap, climb, and sneak through enemy territory with fluid mobility and deadly silence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle Conquest System</strong> \u2013 Reclaim one fortress at a time to rebuild your dominion and revive the age of vampires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorable NPC Encounters</strong> \u2013 Meet bizarre allies who offer both comedy and mystery on your dark journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Power</strong> \u2013 Regain your vampiric abilities as you grow stronger, unlocking new traversal and combat options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you return as ruler of the night, or fade once more into myth?</p>",
